title: "AKGut: Flux-Balance Analysis of alpha-Ketoglutarate Overproduction in Escherichia coli Nissle 1917"
abstract: >-
  Genome-scale metabolic modelling (flux balance analysis on iHM1533) used to
  design and evaluate Escherichia coli Nissle 1917 strains that secrete
  alpha-ketoglutarate, for the UH iGEM 2026 AKGut project.
